    old "Sarah continued to watch him take Mary. Hard. Constant. The way he had been with her."
    new "Sarah siguió observándolo tomar a María. Duro. Constante. De la misma manera que había hecho con ella."

    old "Sarah felt her sex begin to grow warm."
